{title: This Is Amazing Grace}
{artist: Bethel Music}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Verse}
[C] Who breaks the power of sin and darkness
[F] Whose love is mighty and so much stronger
[Am] The King of Glory,[G] the King above all kin[F]gs
[C] Who shakes the whole earth wth holy thunder
[F] Who leaves us breathless in awe and wonder
[Am] The King of glory,[G] the King above all kin[F]gs

{comment: Chorus}
This is amazing [C]grace, this is unfailing [F]love
That You would take my [Am]place, that You would bear my [G]cross
You would lay down Your [C]life, that I would be set [F]free
[Am] Jesus, I sing for [G]all that You've done for [C]me

{comment: Verse}
[C] Who brings our chaos back into order
[F] Who makes the orphan a son and daughter
[Am] The King of glory,[G] the King above all king[F]s
[C] Who rules the nations with truth and justice
[F] Shines like the sun in all of its brilliance
[Am] The King of glory,[G] the King above all king[F]s

{comment: Bridge}
[C]Worthy is the Lamb who was slain
[F]Worthy is the King who conquered the grave
[Am]Worthy is the Lamb who was slain
[F]Worthy is the King who conquered the grave
